ame=\"text-gray-500 text-sm ml-2\">vs last month</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n    \n          \n          <div className=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm hover transition-shadow border-l-4 border-green-500\">\n            <div className=\"flex justify-between items-start\">\n              <div>\n                <p className=\"text-gray-500 text-sm font-medium\">Active Users</p>\n                <h3 className=\"text-2xl font-bold mt-1 text-gray-800\">1,429</h3>\n              </div>\n              <div className=\"bg-green-100 p-2 rounded-lg\">\n                <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" className=\"h-6 w-6 text-green-600\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\">\n                  <path strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\" strokeWidth=\"2\" d=\"M12 4.354a4 4 0 110 5.292M15 21H3v-1a6 6 0 0112 0v1zm0 0h6v-1a6 6 0 00-9-5.197M13 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z\" />\n                </svg>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div className=\"mt-4 flex items-center\">\n              <span className=\"text-green-500 text-sm font-medium flex items-center\">\n                <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" className=\"h-4 w-4 mr-1\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\">\n                  <path strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\" strokeWidth=\"2\" d=\"M5 10l7-7m0 0l7 7m-7-7v18\" />\n                </svg>\n                +8.2%\n              </span>\n              <span className=\"text-gray-500 text-sm ml-2\">vs last month</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n    \n          \n          <div className=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm hover transition-shadow border-l-4 border-purple-500\">\n            <div className=\"flex justify-between items-start\">\n              <div>\n                <p className=\"text-gray-500 text-sm font-medium\">Conversion Rate</p>\n                <h3 className=\"text-2xl font-bold mt-1 text-gray-800\">3.42%</h3>\n              </div>\n              <div className=\"bg-purple-100 p-2 rounded-lg\">\n                <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" className=\"h-6 w-6 text-purple-600\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\">\n                  <path strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\" strokeWidth=\"2\" d=\"M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2z\" />\n                </svg>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div className=\"mt-4 flex items-center\">\n              <span className=\"text-red-500 text-sm font-medium flex items-center\">\n                <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" className=\"h-4 w-4 mr-1\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\">\n                  <path strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\" strokeWidth=\"2\" d=\"M19 14l-7 7m0 0l-7-7m7 7V3\" />\n                </svg>\n                -1.1%\n              </span>\n              <span className=\"text-gray-500 text-sm ml-2\">vs last month</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n    \n          \n          <div className=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm hover transition-shadow border-l-4 border-amber-500\">\n            <div className=\"flex justify-between items-start\">\n              <div>\n                <p className=\"text-gray-500 text-sm font-medium\">Avg. Session</p>\n                <h3 className=\"text-2xl font-bold mt-1 text-gray-800\">4m 32s</h3>\n              </div>\n              <div className=\"bg-amber-100 p-2 rounded-lg\">\n                <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" className=\"h-6 w-6 text-amber-600\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\">\n                  <path strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\" strokeWidth=\"2\" d=\"M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\" />\n                </svg>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div className=\"mt-4 flex items-center\">\n              <span className=\"text-green-500 text-sm font-medium flex items-center\">\n                <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" className=\"h-4 w-4 mr-1\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\">\n                  <path strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\" strokeWidth=\"2\" d=\"M5 10l7-7m0 0l7 7m-7-7v18\" />\n                </svg>\n                +2.4%\n              </span>\n              <span className=\"text-gray-500 text-sm ml-2\">vs last month</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n",
